"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4155960","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4154390-1844751498219127","game_id":"steam-4154390","kind":"announcement","title":"Companion Falls for You: Desktop Slippers","summary":"Exciting news!Desktop Slippers is part of the Companion Falls for You event!Play the Desktop Slippers demo during the event and support other desktop companion games.I hope you will enjoy all the titles you can find there.And don't forget to wishlist Desktop Slippers","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T17:10:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219127","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4154390-1818752592133225","game_id":"steam-4154390","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.7.0: Async levels loading","summary":"Until now, the game loaded levels synchronously, in the same thread that the rest of the game uses. This meant the game was unresponsive during level loading. This was most noticeable when applying a new level in the shop and also made the game launch slower.With patch 0.7.0, I've changed the level-loading behavior to be asynchronous by utilizing a separate thread for this operation. This makes the game launch smoother and level changes more responsive. There are no more freezes when pressing th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-15T15:20:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592133225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4154390-1818118366182290","game_id":"steam-4154390","kind":"announcement","title":"Desktop Slippers Demo Launching for Taskbar Treasures Week!","summary":"Exciting news!Desktop Slippers has been accepted into Taskbar Treasures Week!To make the event even better, the playable demo will go live right when the fest begins.I hope you will stop by the event page, try the demo, and let me know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-08T11:25:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366182290","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4154390-1816307528968114","game_id":"steam-4154390","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Registration Now Open!","summary":"I'm happy to announce that playtest registration for Desktop Slippers is now open! You can sign up right on the Steam page to be among the first to try it once it's ready.The upcoming playtest will focus on the core balance and game stability. Your feedback will help shape how the game feels before release.If you'd like to help out, click the Request Access button on the game page. Steam will notify you automatically when the playtest begins. You can also join the Discord channel, where all feed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-16T11:07:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528968114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4154390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4154390":"2026-10-26T11:43:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4154390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:35Z"},"4155960":{"last_attempt_at":"202